---
/* Recorte DER de especialização/generalização. */
---

<figure class="specialization-diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 560 300"
    class="specialization-diagram__svg"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Recorte conceitual de especialização entre Pessoa, Aluno e Professor"
  >
    <rect x="218" y="32" width="124" height="54" rx="2" class="entity" />
    <text x="280" y="59" class="text-node">PESSOA</text>

    <path d="M 280 86 L 280 100" class="connector" />
    <path d="M 280 100 L 310 146 L 250 146 Z" class="isa" />
    <path d="M 250 146 L 196 168" class="connector" />
    <path d="M 310 146 L 364 168" class="connector" />

    <rect x="88" y="168" width="124" height="54" rx="2" class="subtype" />
    <text x="150" y="195" class="text-node">ALUNO</text>

    <rect x="348" y="168" width="124" height="54" rx="2" class="subtype" />
    <text x="410" y="195" class="text-node">PROFESSOR</text>

    <text x="280" y="258" class="text-note">
      Dados comuns ficam no supertipo; regras específicas ficam nos subtipos.
    </text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Recorte conceitual de especialização entre Pessoa, Aluno e Professor.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .specialization-diagram {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-inline-code, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3));
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12));
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem 1rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .specialization-diagram__svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-system, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);
  }

  .entity,
  .subtype {
    fill: var(--sl-color-bg, #0f172a);
    stroke-width: 1.7;
  }

  .entity {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3, #94a3b8);
  }

  .subtype {
    fill: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.1);
    stroke: #c084fc;
  }

  .isa {
    fill: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-text-accent, #38bdf8);
    stroke-width: 1.7;
  }

  .connector {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3, #94a3b8);
    stroke-width: 1.7;
  }

  .text-node,
  .text-label,
  .text-note {
    text-anchor: middle;
    dominant-baseline: central;
  }

  .text-node {
    fill: var(--sl-color-text, #f8fafc);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .text-label {
    fill: var(--sl-color-text-accent, #38bdf8);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .text-note {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2, #cbd5e1);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  figcaption {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3, #94a3b8);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
